Robert,

I've attached the briefing and the coverage workbook for our August 13 review=
 at 10:00 EDT. Slide 2 shows where Lauren's hours overlap the Thursday openin=
gs. In the morning, we have coverage only from 10:00 to 10:30, enough for Ref=
erence. Lauren can staff all three slots in the 13:00=E2=80=9314:30 EDT openi=
ng. With Tuesday unchanged, that gives us 12 assignable positions per date, f=
our per condition.

Could we use tomorrow's review to decide whether to retain the September 12 a=
fternoon hold for preparation? I'd like to leave run authorization explicitly=
 pending for the September 3 review.

Lauren and Anthony, please use the Slots sheet in the coverage workbook (BCE-=
CE-2024-TBL-010-R01) to check exact start and end times for each slot. That w=
ay we can read the same times against the diary and Anthony's slot check duri=
ng the review.

Thanks,
Melissa

